&lt;img alt="" class="lazyload" data-alt="全新「Granular Alchemy Sound Pack」為Logic Pro帶來一系列為此新模式而設的精選循環樂段與預設音色。（蘋果官方圖片）" data-link="" data-src="https://static06.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4150000/4154533/Apple-Creator-Studio-Logic-Pro-Beat-Breaker_600.jpg" src="https://static06.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4150000/4154533/Apple-Creator-Studio-Logic-Pro-Beat-Breaker_600.jpg" style="max-width:100%; height:auto;"/&gt;
